From e4f354e06fd29f49cc74e3cf4ccf4480f6cf8ec8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:21:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [ASTER] Add integrity overview and
 user-driven KSU verification

Add an environment integrity page with mode controls, current evidence,
retained alarms and manual rechecks. Show KernelSU candidates between the
overview and managed features only when candidates exist.

Let the user explicitly query a version and select a Release asset through the
ASTER service. Use grouped status rows, dedicated source-request feedback and
English/Chinese resources.

Keep existing FAS and TEE user settings while displaying effective restrictions
and waiting states. Add the Trust and search entries only where supported.

Change-Id: I38bd3607e87efde3c36a4de7eec08a1835016d85
